  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f44" contextRef="c1">&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;1.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;Nature of Operations&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;PGPipeline LLC (the "Company") is a Pennsylvania limited liability company.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;The Company operates a natural gas pipeline in Clearfield County, PA; consisting of approximately eight miles of 6-inch diameter coated steel pipeline and appurtenant facilities.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;The Company&#39;s natural gas transmission system is subject to the jurisdiction of the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission ("FERC").&amp;#160;&amp;#160;The pipeline was constructed to provide natural gas transportation service under a FERC approved Negotiated Rate Firm Transportation Agreement (the "Agreement") with a grain production ethanol plant.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;The Company does not have any customers other than a related party to which it provides services.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;2.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;Summary of Significant Account Policies&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Utility Regulation&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;The accompanying financial statements were prepared in conformity with the accounting practice prescribed by the FERC, as set forth in the applicable Uniform System of Accounting releases, which is a comprehensive basis of accounting other than principles generally accepted in the United States of America (&amp;#8220;GAAP&amp;#8221;).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Use of Estimates in the Preparation of the Financial Statements&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;The preparation of financial statements in conformity with the accounting practice prescribed by the FERC requires management to make estimates and assumption that affect the reported amounts of assets and liabilities, disclosure of contingent assets and liabilities at the date of the financial statements and reported amounts of revenue and expenses during the reporting period.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;Actual amounts could differ from these estimates.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Property, Plant and Equipment&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;The Company&#39;s property, plant and equipment consists of the cost incurred to construct a single pipeline lateral.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;The cost of the pipeline is being depreciated on a straight-line basis over the estimated useful life of the assets approximating 25 years consistent with the Commission&#39;s order issuing the Company&#39;s certificate, T.W. Phillips Pipeline Corporation, 126 FERC Para. 30, 132 (2009).&amp;#160;&amp;#160;This differs from GAAP as the Company&amp;#8217;s property, plant and equipment would be depreciated based on the fair value at the time of acquisition from T.W Phillips Pipeline Corporation.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;The Company follows the practice of charging to maintenance expenses the cost of repairs of property.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;The cost of replacement of property is charged to property, plant and equipment accounts with appropriate credits to such accounts for property retired.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;During 2024, the Company reviewed its regulatory accounting practices in light of the FERC Policy Statement on the Treatment of Income Taxes (Docket No. PL17-1-000, issued July 2018). Based on the ownership structure and pass-through tax status, the Company has elected to discontinue the recording of income tax expense for both current and deferred taxes in its financial statements and FERC reporting. This change became effective as of January 1, 2024 and applies prospectively. This accounting treatment reflects the Company&amp;#8217;s status as an LLC and ensures compliance with FERC policies regarding the exclusion of income tax allowances for pass-through entities owned by individuals or entities not subject to income tax.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Previously, in conformity with accounting practice prescribed by the FERC, the Company prepared financial statements as if it was a C Corporation required to file federal and state income tax returns. Deferred income tax assets and liabilities are provided, representing future efforts on income taxes for temporary differences between the basis of assets and liabilities for financial reporting and tax purposes. Adjustments to deferred income tax assets and liabilities as a result of changes in temporary differences are recorded in provision of deferred income taxes or provision for deferred income taxes &amp;#8211; credit on the statements of income. This differs from GAAP in that a Limited Liability Company would not record deferred income tax assets and liabilities or income tax expense. The Company has not identified any uncertain tax positions as of December 31, 2025 and 2024.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Revenue Recognition&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;tahoma&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;tahoma&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;The Company recognizes revenue from contracts with their customer when control of the promised product transfers to the customer. This generally occurs when the product is delivered to the customer. Revenue is recorded at the amount of consideration the Company expects to be entitled to in exchange for product.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;table style="border: none;border-collapse: collapse;margin-bottom: .001pt;margin-left: 0;width: 100%;"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 215.75pt;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 13.5pt;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 13.5pt;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 63pt;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 49.5pt;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 67.5pt;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 36pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 13.5pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 13.3pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 53.95pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 215.75pt;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 13.5pt;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 13.5pt;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 63pt;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 49.5pt;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 67.5pt;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 36pt;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 13.5pt;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 13.3pt;"&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border-bottom-style: none;border-left-style: none;border-right-style: none;border-top-style: none;padding-bottom: 0;padding-left: 5.4pt;padding-right: 5.4pt;padding-top: 0;vertical-align: top;width: 53.95pt;"&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;tahoma&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;tahoma&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-family: &#39;tahoma&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-weight:bold;display:inline;"&gt;3.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;Subsequent Events&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;tahoma&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="color: #000000;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;tahoma&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;
