mso-bidi-language:AR-SA;display:inline;"&gt;In February 2026, the Company declared and paid a
distribution to its sole member of $800,000. The Company evaluates and determines
that there were no additional subsequent events through April 16, 2026, which
represents the date the financial statements were available for issuance.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;tahoma&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;
