  <ferc:DescriptionOfPlantAndOperationsOfRespondentTextblock id="f146" contextRef="c1">&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0.50in;margin-top: 0;text-indent: -0.25in;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;1.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 4;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;PGPipeline LLC owns and operates a natural gas pipeline in Clearfield County, PA consisting of approximately eight miles of 6-inch diameter coated steel pipeline and appurtenant facilities.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;The pipeline runs from a metering station at the interconnection with Columbia Gas Transmission Corporation&amp;#8217;s existing 16-inch diameter pipeline in Boggs Township, Clearfield County, PA, to an ethanol production plant owned by Pennsylvania Grain Processing LLC located in the Borough of Clearfield, Clearfield County, PA.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;The pipeline is primarily designed to provide firm transportation delivery capacity to serve all of the natural gas requirements of the ethanol plant.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0.50in;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0.50in;margin-top: 0;text-indent: -0.25in;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;2.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 4;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;Please refer to the response to item #1 for the location, size, and nature of the transmission pipeline facilities.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;The Company has no operated or un-operated gas lands, gas wells, gathering lines, compressor stations or gas storage facilities.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;calibri&#39;;font-size: 10pt;line-height: 107.9%;margin-bottom: 8pt;margin-left: 0.50in;margin-top: 0;"&gt;&lt;div  style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;margin-bottom: 0;margin-left: 0.50in;margin-top: 0;text-indent: -0.25in;"&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;3.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;&lt;div style="spacecount: 4;;display:inline;"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="font-family: &#39;arial&#39;, &#39;sans-serif&#39;;font-size: 10pt;font-style: ;font-weight: ;;display:inline;"&gt;There have been no important changes in the scope of operations during 2025.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
</ferc:DescriptionOfPlantAndOperationsOfRespondentTextblock>
